{"at":"2026-10-30T03:19:56.725Z","component":"Flatpak application identity propagation","evidence":["00cbd8f8d8195ce6e7578a569630a0bb0cd13cf1c3550bbca784d8feb93a8343","075f55208e09392190b3d5638343d3dc930169d51a4fa330db0cc830debec889","488de16a8d8624dc5029e4d16717e54623fc84f20cb5ef88a6425033b0432c6d","4b2476a46e05088d3430f403694411c0197dff78f09505d5aab4be73ee21d25e","51926e2621385e7fee3ad0a65498fe019bdb8f05b3dc7799f33c2b367b663889","65e59699d1c930bd4e0de5a209d563b12d017383de3b1bdf7e225b7b2db38b9a","7ed34b48c53927dff9519249a841d86bd33e9656f8878a2af61e76e464b76d27","9221982608ba98507c92eaa267a56ebd375dcf0444f108fcafbe92d2335e6d17"],"id":"ad4df84d7e6c8f9ec5493507b4fa4cc4ca5a43efb4894ab9b762c06be260fa30","kind":"lesson","paths":["taskcluster/kinds/release-flatpak-repackage/kind.yml","taskcluster/comm_taskgraph/transforms/release_flatpak_repackage.py","taskcluster/docker/tb-flatpak/launch_script.in","taskcluster/docker/tb-flatpak/repack.sh","taskcluster/docker/tb-flatpak/org.mozilla.thunderbird.metainfo.xml.in"],"quotes":[{"id":"075f55208e09392190b3d5638343d3dc930169d51a4fa330db0cc830debec889","text":"task[\"attributes\"][\"flatpak_name\"] = task[\"worker\"][\"env\"][\"APP_ID\"]"},{"id":"00cbd8f8d8195ce6e7578a569630a0bb0cd13cf1c3550bbca784d8feb93a8343","text":"exec /app/lib/thunderbird/thunderbird --name $APP_ID \"$@\""},{"id":"4b2476a46e05088d3430f403694411c0197dff78f09505d5aab4be73ee21d25e","text":"<launchable type=\"desktop-id\">${APP_ID}.desktop</launchable>"}],"repository":"thunderbird","source":{"basis":"Quoted evidence supports the claim; its interpretation still needs current-source checks.","revision":"0b93f0f7a926ed94c8a0646f18b6734ec7cc0f6d","sourceAt":"2026-10-05T22:44:59Z","type":"extraction"},"status":"supported","supersedes":[],"text":"The resolved APP_ID is copied into flatpak_name and reused for the launcher's --name, metainfo/desktop identity, locale/application refs, icon paths and bundle files. Branch and desktop VERSION_FLAG selection remain separate. The owned addition is immediately backed out by exact blob inverses, while accepted support includes later metainfo, argument-array and DBus changes. These static connections do not prove a launch, package or release push succeeded.","title":"Flatpak APP_ID connects the launcher, package metadata and bundle names","version":1,"visibility":"shared"}
